<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Fin Min says bank merger natural.</title>
<headline>Swedish Fin Min says bank merger natural.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish Finance Minister Erik Asbrink said on Tuesday that the merger between Swedbank and Foreningsbanken was a natural step in the restructuring going on in the Swedish and international banking sector.  </p>
<p>Asbrink said in a statement that the Swedish banking sector was preparing itself for increased competition and major investment costs.</p>
<p>&quot;The result should be stronger and more competitive banks with good possibilities to develop,&quot; said Asbrink.</p>
<p>-- Simon Haydon, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1004</p>
